# DevPilot daily backup timer
# 18:30 UTC (KST 03:30) — 결정 C. 앱의 CoachContentPurgeJob(18:20)·RetentionCleanupJob 시각과 겹치지 않는지 docs/03 §6에서 확인
# 기준: docs/03-system-architecture.md §6, docs/10-deployment-and-operations.md §8 (2026-09-18)

[Unit]
Description=Run DevPilot backup daily

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 18:30:00 UTC
RandomizedDelaySec=300
Persistent=true
Unit=devpilot-backup.service

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
